    "sections": {
        "description": "Safety Wear is a specialized theme tailored for businesses in the safety and protective industry, delivering advanced features for personal protective equipment and industrial products. It supports suppliers of safety clothing, helmets, footwear, gloves, masks, eye and ear protection, reflective wear, and emergency rescue tools. Focused on construction safety, it highlights armor, tactical supply, police equipment, fall protection, hazardous suits, and industrial uniforms. It enables catalog display, product listings, and service promotion for manufacturers, distributors, and retailers in the security gear sector. Suitable for companies in manufacturing, engineering, and emergency response, it helps build a strong online presence for protective wear solutions. With a responsive design and user-friendly structure, it ensures smooth browsing and effective presentation of gear collections. This theme is ideal for businesses seeking professional digital storefronts and reliable presentation of safety equipment across various industries."
    },
